  "details": "The new update to the avatar menu is not well liked, and there are a few reasons why.\n\nFrom a design standpoint, making the avatar menu open into the Explore Page to purchase avatars is an example of a Dark Pattern in design, it makes accessing your avatars more of a chore and tries to push you to interact with a feature that a lot of the playerbase does not want to.\n\nThe redesign of the normal avatar menu also makes it inconsistent with other menus such as the Social tab, while decreasing its readability overall.\n\nI believe a rollback or redesign of the Avatar Menu in concordance with the new Avatar Marketplace to make it less intrusive would bode well with your current playerbase while still allowing newer and less active players to enjoy the new marketplace.",
